  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4202.11 \"Prescribed filing date\" means the date pursuant to RSA 146-A:11-b, IV, on which reports are required to be filed with the bureau.\n\nSource. #10025, eff 11-16-11, EXPIRED: 11-16-19 (from Saf-C 4202.07)\n\nNew. #13019, eff 4-7-20",
